OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'slightly mad' new life
OL,4,Afarming on remote Welsh island
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn an island where Manx shearwater
OL,7,Fbirds outnumber humans by about 2,500
OL,8,Fto one, a couple from south Wales have
OL,9,Fswapped city life for a remote living
OL,10,Fdream.
OL,12,FGwyndaf Hughes and Georgina Rannard
OL,13,Fwill become the new farmers on Ynys
OL,14,FEnlli - also known as Bardsey Island -
OL,15,Ftwo miles off the LlE7n Peninsula, in
OL,16,FGwynedd.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
