OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'slightly mad' new life
OL,4,Afarming on remote Welsh island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe journalists, who live in Barry,
OL,7,FVale of Glamorgan, admit it will be
OL,8,Fdaunting to leave their old life behind
OL,9,Fduring their year-long career break,
OL,10,Fbut are excited to be doing this
OL,11,F"slightly mad thing".
OL,13,FThey'll be joining only a handful of
OL,14,Fother permanent residents on Ynys
OL,15,FEnlli, which is home to 200 sheep and
OL,16,Faround 30,000 breeding pairs of Manx
OL,17,Fshearwater birds.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
